+## Rework 2 — Draft / Refinement mock fixture isolation
+
+The coordinator's second rejection named `generate_ui::draft_refine::tests::draft_refine_mock_comfy_uses_source_and_library_results_can_be_used_or_opened`. The earlier rework is now committed by li-land as `709846bf`. Running the requested merge against `claude/sleepy-franklin-egimjb` (`9247cc39`) reports `Already up to date.`; the branch already contains that coordinator head and both sets of changes. No additional merge conflicts exist.
